Z||000000||DISenchanted||02-07-2000||01:49 AM||||After driving my 88gt today for about 2 hours, I started hearing this high-pitched Whistle.  It sounded like the air intake, but from the vents.  I pulled over and got out.  I heard it comming from below the car as well.  Shortly after this the car started acting like it was out of gas.  I let it cool down for 2 hours and it now runs fine.  Any ideas?||||reg||1
Z||000001||DRH||02-07-2000||02:35 AM||||One time my 88 Formula started making an unusual high pitched sound. It was really hard to tell where it was coming from. Seemed to move as I moved around the car listening. Finally realized it was the fuel pump... Immediately remembered I was probably 20 miles past my usual absolute minimum. Duhhhh...<P>Pulled across the street to the gas station... filled up... everything was fine.<P>Not sure if this relates to your problem but it MIGHT be fuel pump related???<P><p>[This message has been edited by DRH (edited 02-07-2000).]||||reg||11
